msgid "Queues: First In, First Out"
msgstr "队列：先进先出"

msgid "A **queue** is a linked list where we insert nodes at the **tail** and remove nodes at the **head**. Think of a line of people waiting at a store: new people join at the end of the line, and the person at the front is served first. This is called **FIFO: First In, First Out**. A queue has two operations:"
msgstr "**队列**（queue）是一种在**尾部**插入节点、在**头部**删除节点的链表。想象在商店里排队的人：新来的人排在队尾，排在最前面的人先被服务。这被称为 **FIFO：先进先出**（First In, First Out）。队列有两个操作："

msgid "`enqueue(d)`: insert the value `d` at the tail."
msgstr "`enqueue(d)`：在尾部插入值 `d`。"

msgid "`dequeue()`: remove and return the oldest value, which is at the head."
msgstr "`dequeue()`：删除并返回最早进入的值，它位于头部。"

msgid "For example, after `q.enqueue(1); q.enqueue(2);`, the queue looks like this, and the next `q.dequeue()` returns `1`:"
msgstr "例如，执行 `q.enqueue(1); q.enqueue(2);` 之后，队列如下所示，下一次 `q.dequeue()` 返回 `1`："

msgid "Unlike a stack, a queue inserts and removes at **different** ends."
msgstr "与栈不同，队列在**不同的**两端插入和删除。"

msgid "The `Queue` class"
msgstr "`Queue` 类"

msgid "To insert at the tail without walking through the whole list, a queue keeps a second pointer, `tail`, to its last node. We use the `Node` class from the From Arrays to Linked Lists section."
msgstr "为了在尾部插入时不必遍历整个链表，队列保存了第二个指针 `tail`，指向它的最后一个节点。我们使用“从数组到链表”一节中的 `Node` 类。"

msgid "**Code in `queue.h`**"
msgstr "**`queue.h` 中的代码**"

msgid "**Line 7.** An empty queue has no nodes, so both `head` and `tail` are `nullptr`."
msgstr "**第 7 行。** 空队列没有节点，所以 `head` 和 `tail` 都是 `nullptr`。"

msgid "**Line 8.** Like the destructor of `Stack`, deleting the first node frees all the nodes in the queue."
msgstr "**第 8 行。** 和 `Stack` 的析构函数一样，删除第一个节点会释放队列中的所有节点。"

msgid "`enqueue`"
msgstr "`enqueue`"

msgid "**Line 2.** The new node will be the last node, so its `next` is `nullptr`."
msgstr "**第 2 行。** 新节点将成为最后一个节点，所以它的 `next` 是 `nullptr`。"

msgid "**Line 3 to 5.** If the queue is not empty, we link the old last node to the new node."
msgstr "**第 3 到 5 行。** 如果队列不为空，我们把原来的最后一个节点连接到新节点。"

msgid "**Line 6.** `tail` points to the new last node."
msgstr "**第 6 行。** `tail` 指向新的最后一个节点。"

msgid "**Line 7 to 9.** If the queue was empty, the new node is also the first node, so `head` points to it too."
msgstr "**第 7 到 9 行。** 如果队列原来是空的，新节点同时也是第一个节点，所以 `head` 也指向它。"

msgid "`dequeue`"
msgstr "`dequeue`"

msgid "`dequeue` is the same as `pop` of a stack, except for lines 8 to 10."
msgstr "除了第 8 到 10 行之外，`dequeue` 与栈的 `pop` 完全相同。"

msgid "**Line 2 to 4.** If the queue is empty, we return `-1`."
msgstr "**第 2 到 4 行。** 如果队列是空的，我们返回 `-1`。"

msgid "**Line 5 to 7.** We save the data of the first node, and `head` moves to the second node."
msgstr "**第 5 到 7 行。** 我们保存第一个节点的数据，`head` 移到第二个节点。"

msgid "**Line 8 to 10.** If we removed the only node, the queue is now empty, so `tail` must become `nullptr` too."
msgstr "**第 8 到 10 行。** 如果我们删除的是唯一的节点，队列现在为空，所以 `tail` 也必须变为 `nullptr`。"

msgid "**Line 11 to 13.** We detach the old first node, delete it, and return its data."
msgstr "**第 11 到 13 行。** 我们分离原来的第一个节点，删除它，并返回它的数据。"

msgid "Like `pop`, `dequeue` must check whether `head` is `nullptr` before dereferencing it, and must call `old_head->setNext(nullptr)` before `delete old_head;`. Otherwise, it dereferences `nullptr` on an empty queue, or deletes the entire linked list."
msgstr "和 `pop` 一样，`dequeue` 必须在解引用 `head` 之前检查它是否为 `nullptr`，并且必须在 `delete old_head;` 之前调用 `old_head->setNext(nullptr)`。否则，它会在空队列上解引用 `nullptr`，或者删除整个链表。"

msgid "**<span style=\"color:red\">Problem: What if we do not reset `tail` after removing the last node?</span>** Without lines 8 to 10, dequeuing the only node frees it, but `tail` still stores its address:"
msgstr "**<span style=\"color:red\">问题：如果删除最后一个节点后不重置 `tail` 会怎样？</span>** 如果没有第 8 到 10 行，删除唯一的节点时会释放它，但 `tail` 仍然存储着它的地址："

msgid "The next `enqueue` sees `tail != nullptr` and calls `tail->setNext(new_tail)` on freed memory, which is undefined behavior. **An empty queue must have both pointers equal to `nullptr`.**"
msgstr "下一次 `enqueue` 看到 `tail != nullptr`，就会在已释放的内存上调用 `tail->setNext(new_tail)`，这是未定义行为。**空队列的两个指针都必须等于 `nullptr`。**"

msgid "Putting it all together"
msgstr "把所有部分组合起来"

msgid "**Code** {{code_runner_header}}"
msgstr "**代码** {{code_runner_header}}"

msgid "**Output**"
msgstr "**输出**"

msgid "The values leave the queue in the **same** order they entered. After the third `dequeue`, both `head` and `tail` are `nullptr`, so the next `enqueue(4)` correctly treats the queue as empty. If any nodes were left in the queue, its destructor would free them when `q` goes out of scope."
msgstr "值离开队列的顺序与进入的顺序**相同**。第三次 `dequeue` 之后，`head` 和 `tail` 都是 `nullptr`，所以下一次 `enqueue(4)` 能正确地把队列当作空队列处理。如果队列中还剩有节点，当 `q` 离开作用域时，它的析构函数会释放它们。"

